Description:It is your first main phase. You have Grim Affliction (put a -1/-1 counter on target creature, then proliferate) in hand with three black mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Hill Giant and Grizzly Bears, each with one -1/-1 counter. Destroy both of the opponent's creatures this turn.
Rule:authored-proliferate-minus-counters | Proliferate adds one counter of each kind already on each chosen permanent, and state-based actions wait until the spell has resolved (CR 701.34a, 704.3): the counter goes on the Giant (2), proliferate both makes Giant 3 and Bears 2 counters; aimed at the Bears, the Giant ends with only 2
